## 4. AI Working Agreement
- Always inspect this file and the documents under `docs/` before proposing code changes.
- Ensure all public functions are typed (`def fn(param: Type) -> ReturnType:`) and contain detailed Google-style docstrings.
- Never write placeholder code or omit sections (e.g., `# TODO: implement this`). Write production-ready, clean, scalable logic.
- Maintain existing codebase comments and formatting rules.
